flowchart LR
    A[Full page of sheet music] --> B[Deskew whole page]
    B --> C[Staff line detection]
    C --> D[Segment measures and symbols]
    D --> E[Classify each symbol:<br/>pitch + duration]
    E --> F[Assemble multi-note,<br/>multi-measure MusicXML]

    classDef done fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000
    classDef partial fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000
    classDef todo fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,color:#000
    class E,F partial
    class A,B,C,D todo
